+// EDEN_NX2_LOOP_SKIP=1: the front does not send the instance loop writes the back ignores.
+// From Lichii PR 178 (zortos293/Lichii, head 95a227b710). Ocarina sent 520,000 draw.end and 390,000
+// same-value vertex_buffer.count writes a second there; each is a ring entry and a method call on
+// the back, which is the busy thread. Lichii checked it with EDEN_NX2_SPLIT_VERIFY (0 differences).
+bool FrontLoopSkip() {
+    static const bool skip = [] {
+        const char* value = std::getenv("EDEN_NX2_LOOP_SKIP");
+        return value != nullptr && value[0] == '1';
+    }();
+    return skip;
+}
